# Weight profile ornith-1.5-122b-exl3-4.0: Ornith-1.5-122B (MIT) in our EXL3 pack at 4.0 bpw: every projection at 4 bits,
# head 6, MTP layer 4, vision tower 6 (exllamav3 1.6.2, mul1 codebook; 64.6 GB), converted from ornith-ai/Ornith-1.5-122B
# at revision e09bc0dfbe. Against the BF16 checkpoint's logits (8 wikitext rows x 1,024, this engine): KL 0.139,
# top-1 86.2 %, ppl 7.27 against BF16's 7.09. Drafts with the DFlash2 drafter for Ornith and the lookup; measured on the
# Spark (2026-10-20, 512 greedy tokens, thinking off, one fresh server a row): plain 37.5 / 38.4 / 37.8 / 38.2 / 38.2
# tok/s on prose / code / chat / edit / copy asks, DFlash2 + lookup 59.5 / 76.0 / 51.1 / 78.3 / 106.7, every text the
# plain run's. The pack is in a private Hugging Face repository (a download needs a token with access).
# Switch with ops/use-profile.sh ornith-1.5-122b-exl3-4.0.
QSE_ORN_VARIANT=exl3-4.0
QSE_WEIGHTS_HF=0xBakeer/TandemLLM-Ornith-1.5-122B-EXL3-4.0
QSE_WEIGHTS_REVISION=9e73dddc081cc178408bdb79025d7fcbca1ffd6c
QSE_WEIGHTS_GB=64.6
# the DFlash2 drafter (BF16, 1.86 GB; models/ornith-1.5-122b/model.yaml fetches it): 2.35 GiB allocated at load, its
# context ring included; the pack's MTP layer is not loaded then
QSE_ORN_HEAD=dflash2
QSE_ORN_DFLASH2=${HOME}/models/ornith-1.5-122b-dflash2
QSE_ASSETS="${QSE_ORN_DFLASH2}/model.safetensors"
# MemAvailable (GiB) a start needs: the weights (59.95 allocated), the drafter (2.35), the engine and its graphs, the KV at
# 262,144 tokens, the allocator, the prefill workspace and the 15 GiB floor
QSE_MEM_NEED_GIB=95
# the engine's limits: the weights and the drafter (62.3) + the runtime (an estimate of 4) + the KV at 262,144 tokens (6.5)
# + the vision tower and its image cache (1); peak: the ceiling + the prefill workspace (an estimate of 4)
MEM_CEILING_GIB=76
MEM_PEAK_GIB=80
. "${REPO}/ops/profiles/_ornith.env"
